          "description": "Use this when the user asks which ETFs hold a stock, which ETF holds the most of it, how many ETFs hold it, or whether it is in VOO, SPY, IVV, QQQ, VTI or SCHD. Returns the covered US ETFs that hold it, largest weight first, each with its weight, rank, dollars, holdings date and source, plus the count, how many hold it as their largest position, the ETFs and issuers with the most dollars in it, and one sentence to quote. The list keeps the heaviest holders; whether the six ETFs above hold it is in every answer for a stock with its own file, unless compact is true. ETFs holding it through swaps, futures or options are listed apart, as notional exposure. A private company",
